Z||000008||Mattsfiero||08-30-2000||08:19 AM||||I Had a problem with mine when I first got my hands on it...cometo find out the little brass ring on the bottom of the plastic color located in the steering coloum wasn't where is was supposed to be...so try checking there||||reg||1
Z||000009||tired Fiero owner||08-30-2000||07:52 PM||||Thanks all. I found the problem which was the previous owner must have mashed the horn. The little post that sticks out of the steering wheel hub and makes contact with the horn button was driven in a few mm. I made a longer one out of a nail and it works fine.<BR>||||reg||1
